PART 2 - PERMITTED USE AND USER RESPONSIBILITY
----------------------------------------------

2.1  The Software is a general-purpose, content-neutral tool for
     transferring files over standard network protocols (HTTP, HTTPS, FTP,
     HLS, DASH, BitTorrent). It has substantial lawful uses, including
     downloading freely licensed, public-domain, open-source, self-owned
     and otherwise authorized material (for example Linux distributions
     and other software that is officially published as torrents).

2.2  The Software does not host, store, index, recommend, supply or link to
     any content. Every download is chosen and started solely by the user.
