     any user downloads.

2.3  The Software is not designed, intended or promoted for copyright
     infringement. By design it does not circumvent, remove or defeat
     Digital Rights Management (DRM) or any other technological protection
     measure, and it refuses to download content that is detected as
     DRM-protected.

2.4  You are solely and entirely responsible for:
       (a) what you download, upload, store, copy, share or otherwise do
           with the Software and with any content obtained through it,
           including pieces of files that the BitTorrent protocol shares
           with other users while a torrent is downloading or seeding;
       (b) making sure you hold the rights, licenses or permissions needed
           for that content; and
       (c) complying with all laws that apply to you, including copyright
           and related rights laws, and with the terms of service of every
           website or service you access.

2.5  You must not use the Software to infringe copyright or any other
     right of any person, to access content you are not authorized to
